In the Options menu (in Controls), you can now activate\nSonic's Drop Dash move for Normal Game and Act Select.
Play as Knuckles & Tails character combination in Normal\nGame and Act Select.
The Super Peel-Out move is available in the Options menu.\nThis also unlocks \"Max Control\" Time Attack.
Debug Mode can be activated in the Options menu (in\nTweaks), and is available in Normal Game and Act Select.
Adds the Blue Sphere game to Extras that is known from\nSonic 1 locked on to Sonic & Knuckles.
Adds the original Sonic 3 & Knuckles Level Select menu to\nExtras.
You can now select the Sonic & Knuckles title screen in\nthe Options menu.
Ready for a new challenge? Make the game faster (or\nslower) in the Options menu.
